Radiation Monitoring System

Cloud-based SCADA and monitoring platform for radiation control networks.

Technology Stack

Backend:

Java 21
Spring Boot 3.5
Spring Data JPA
PostgreSQL 16

Frontend:

HTML5
JavaScript
Leaflet
Chart.js

Infrastructure:

Google Cloud VM
Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
Nginx
Let's Encrypt
GitHub

Features:

Radiation measurements
Detector management
Station monitoring
Heartbeat monitoring
Event generation
Interactive map
HTTPS secured access

Production URL:
https://radiation.dimlb.id.lv
